# Findings of the scan of the image that are accepted.
#
# The format is the one of the ignore file of trivy, an entry is a finding
# that is not reported. An entry can have an expiry date, the finding is
# reported again when the date is reached.
#
# The findings below are in the dependencies of the upstream project
# m13253/dns-over-https. The version of the dependencies is set by the
# go.mod of the upstream release, they can not be updated in this
# repository. They are listed here so that the scan of the image does not
# fail because of them, and so that they are looked at again when the
# upstream release is updated.
#
# The scan of the operating system packages of the image is not affected by
# this file, every finding there fails the build.

